{"id":"complex-answer-001","name":"老年肾功能不全患者降糖方案综合比较","query":"请综合指南和研究证据，比较老年肾功能不全患者使用二甲双胍与胰岛素时的肾功能限制、低血糖风险、剂量调整、药物相互作用和监测策略，并给出有引用的分层建议。","difficulty":"hard","tags":["complex-qa","multi-agent","drug","renal"],"expected_facts":["eGFR","低血糖","监测"],"required_content":["eGFR","低血糖","监测"],"expected_citation_ids":["complex-metformin-renal","complex-insulin-elderly"],"evidence":[{"evidence_id":"complex-metformin-renal","content":"二甲双胍方案必须结合 eGFR 评估肾功能限制和剂量调整，并监测肾功能及乳酸酸中毒风险；急性肾损伤或严重肾功能下降时需要专业评估。","source_type":"local_knowledge_base","source_name":"renal-diabetes-guideline","retrieval_score":0.95,"authority_level":9,"is_authorized":true,"is_conversation_memory":false},{"evidence_id":"complex-insulin-elderly","content":"老年肾功能不全患者使用胰岛素时清除下降，低血糖风险增加，应个体化降低剂量并加强血糖监测；合并用药和进食变化会进一步影响风险。","source_type":"local_knowledge_base","source_name":"elderly-diabetes-consensus","retrieval_score":0.94,"authority_level":9,"is_authorized":true,"is_conversation_memory":false}]}
{"id":"complex-answer-002","name":"房颤合并消化道出血抗凝决策","query":"请综合指南、既往出血史和肾功能证据，权衡老年房颤患者发生消化道出血后继续抗凝、暂停抗凝与调整剂量的卒中风险、再出血风险、药物相互作用和监测计划，并引用证据。","difficulty":"hard","tags":["complex-qa","multi-agent","cardiology","safety"],"expected_facts":["卒中","再出血","肾功能","监测"],"required_content":["卒中","再出血","肾功能","监测"],"expected_citation_ids":["complex-af-stroke","complex-bleeding-monitor"],"evidence":[{"evidence_id":"complex-af-stroke","content":"老年房颤患者的抗凝决策应同时权衡卒中风险与再出血风险；消化道出血稳定后是否恢复抗凝需要根据出血原因、止血情况和血栓风险个体化决定。","source_type":"local_knowledge_base","source_name":"af-guideline","retrieval_score":0.95,"authority_level":9,"is_authorized":true,"is_conversation_memory":false},{"evidence_id":"complex-bleeding-monitor","content":"老年患者选择和调整抗凝药剂量时需要核对肾功能、年龄、体重和药物相互作用，并安排血红蛋白、肾功能以及再出血征象监测。","source_type":"local_knowledge_base","source_name":"anticoagulation-safety-consensus","retrieval_score":0.93,"authority_level":9,"is_authorized":true,"is_conversation_memory":false}]}
{"id":"complex-answer-003","name":"妊娠期高血压多约束管理","query":"请综合指南证据，分别比较妊娠期高血压使用拉贝洛尔、硝苯地平与甲基多巴的适用场景、禁忌、剂量边界、母胎风险和监测策略，并明确何时需要急诊升级。","difficulty":"hard","tags":["complex-qa","multi-agent","pregnancy","safety"],"expected_facts":["母胎","监测","急诊"],"required_content":["母胎","监测","急诊"],"expected_citation_ids":["complex-pregnancy-drugs","complex-pregnancy-emergency"],"evidence":[{"evidence_id":"complex-pregnancy-drugs","content":"妊娠期高血压药物选择需比较拉贝洛尔、硝苯地平与甲基多巴的适用场景和禁忌，并根据母胎情况制定剂量边界和血压监测计划。","source_type":"local_knowledge_base","source_name":"pregnancy-hypertension-guideline","retrieval_score":0.96,"authority_level":9,"is_authorized":true,"is_conversation_memory":false},{"evidence_id":"complex-pregnancy-emergency","content":"持续重度高血压、胸痛、呼吸困难、神经系统症状或胎儿异常属于高风险信号，需要急诊升级并进行母胎监测。","source_type":"local_knowledge_base","source_name":"obstetric-emergency-consensus","retrieval_score":0.94,"authority_level":9,"is_authorized":true,"is_conversation_memory":false}]}
{"id":"complex-answer-004","name":"多病共存老年患者用药审查","query":"请综合老年医学指南和药物证据，对同时存在心衰、慢性肾病和糖尿病且使用利尿剂、ACEI、SGLT2 抑制剂的患者，分析容量状态、肾功能、电解质、低血压和药物相互作用，并制定分阶段监测与升级策略。","difficulty":"hard","tags":["complex-qa","multi-agent","polypharmacy","renal"],"expected_facts":["容量状态","肾功能","电解质","低血压"],"required_content":["容量状态","肾功能","电解质","低血压"],"expected_citation_ids":["complex-heart-kidney","complex-polypharmacy"],"evidence":[{"evidence_id":"complex-heart-kidney","content":"心衰合并慢性肾病和糖尿病时，应联合评估容量状态、肾功能与电解质；利尿剂、ACEI 和 SGLT2 抑制剂调整后需要复查相关指标。","source_type":"local_knowledge_base","source_name":"cardiorenal-guideline","retrieval_score":0.95,"authority_level":9,"is_authorized":true,"is_conversation_memory":false},{"evidence_id":"complex-polypharmacy","content":"多药联合可能增加低血压、脱水、肾功能波动和电解质异常风险，应分阶段监测症状、血压、肌酐、eGFR 和血钾，并在危险信号出现时升级处理。","source_type":"local_knowledge_base","source_name":"geriatric-polypharmacy-consensus","retrieval_score":0.94,"authority_level":9,"is_authorized":true,"is_conversation_memory":false}]}
{"id":"complex-answer-005","name":"儿童哮喘控制不佳鉴别与升级","query":"请综合儿童哮喘指南和研究证据，分别分析吸入技术、依从性、过敏原、共病和治疗阶梯，比较继续当前方案、增加控制药与转诊的收益风险，并给出监测和急诊升级标准。","difficulty":"hard","tags":["complex-qa","multi-agent","pediatrics","safety"],"expected_facts":["吸入技术","依从性","治疗阶梯","急诊"],"required_content":["吸入技术","依从性","治疗阶梯","急诊"],"expected_citation_ids":["complex-asthma-assessment","complex-asthma-escalation"],"evidence":[{"evidence_id":"complex-asthma-assessment","content":"儿童哮喘控制不佳时应先核对吸入技术、依从性、过敏原暴露和共病，再依据治疗阶梯评估是否增加控制药。","source_type":"local_knowledge_base","source_name":"pediatric-asthma-guideline","retrieval_score":0.95,"authority_level":9,"is_authorized":true,"is_conversation_memory":false},{"evidence_id":"complex-asthma-escalation","content":"持续呼吸困难、发绀、意识改变或缓解药反应差需要急诊升级；反复控制不佳或诊断不确定时应转诊并持续监测。","source_type":"local_knowledge_base","source_name":"asthma-emergency-guideline","retrieval_score":0.94,"authority_level":9,"is_authorized":true,"is_conversation_memory":false}]}
